            "question": "Can I exchange a product for a different shade?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely! We offer free shade exchanges on all foundation, concealer, and lipstick products. Start an exchange through your account and select your preferred new shade. We'll ship the replacement as soon as we receive your return.</p>"
          }
        },
